INSERTION 
IN BST
Three steps of insertion
1.If the root of the tree is NULL, then insert the first 
node and root points to that node.
2.If the inserted number is lesser than the root node 
then insert the node in the left sub-tree.
3.If the inserted number is greater than the root 
node then insert the node in the right sub-tree.
